{"id":"wb-6-584","name":"培田村古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"培田村","text":"培田村位于中国福建省连城县宣和乡（1956年前属长汀县），是一个客家古村落，居民多为吴姓。培田村于2005年被列为中国历史文化名村，培田村古建筑群于2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。连城培田古村于全国旅游景区质量等级评定委员会发布2012年第12号公告中被评为国家4A级旅游景区。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9F%B9%E7%94%B0%E6%9D%91","revisionId":92174564,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92174564","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e4661e83a26ba8a30b00b2d9.jpg","title":"Liancheng_Peitian_2013.10.07_09-09-57.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Liancheng_Peitian_2013.10.07_09-09-57.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/Liancheng_Peitian_2013.10.07_09-09-57.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"福建省连城县培田村——\n\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213}}